# Secrets stay in .env or dotnet user secrets. .env.example keeps the names only.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/appsettings.Production.json
**/appsettings.Production.*.json
**/secrets.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12

/private/
*.md

# Real workbooks and exports. The only tracked spreadsheets are the three fictional Karoo samples.
/data/
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.xlsb
*.csv
*.ods
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
!/samples/Karoo_Outdoor_IS_FY2021-FY2025.xlsx
!/samples/Karoo_Outdoor_IS_FY2021-FY2025_draft.xlsx
!/samples/Karoo_Outdoor_IS_FY2022-FY2026.xlsx

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/*.user

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/

node_modules/
dist/

**/.vs/
**/.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
.nuget/
